                  {
                    "value": "Who owns the downside? debt/equity = 366 \u00f7 619.5 = 0.59x \u2014 lenders' claim per $1 of owners' claim. Does profit cover the interest bill? coverage = EBIT \u00f7 interest = 248.6 \u00f7 25.4 = 9.8x.",
